      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْخَرِقٌ</span></b>  [<i>Having a hole made in it,</i> &amp;c.: see
its verb]. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ مُنْخَرِقُ السِّرْبَالِ</span> <i>A man having his
clothing rent,</i> or <i>torn,</i> (JK, K,) <i>by long travel;</i>
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السِّرْبَال</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَخَرِّقُ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also (assumed tropical:)  <i>Quick,</i>
or <i>swift.</i> (Ham p. 42.)

